        "name": "Human Oversight, Governance, and Legal Considerations",
        "instance": 16,
        "contextid": 76097,
        "description": "<div class=\"no-overflow\"><div style=\"background-color: #eef5fb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #1d2b36;\">Covers what human-in-the-loop practices look like in procurement, how to formalize oversight in policy and training, and what legal and governance frameworks procurement teams need to understand before adopting AI tools.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #33475b;\"><strong>Happy learning!</strong><br>Do you have questions? Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:hello@innovate-us.org\">hello@innovate-us.org</a></p>\r\n</div></div>",
