    "name": "6. AI Implementation Strategies for Procurement Teams",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<p>How to assess readiness, pick a first use case and the right tools, and anticipate common roadblocks to adoption.</p>",
    "summaryformat": 1,
    "section": 6,
