    "name": "7. Strategy to Action: Building Your Procurement AI Plan",
    "visible": 1,
    "summary": "<p>How to turn AI experimentation into an accountable plan, from discovery and alignment through change management and measurement.</p>",
    "summaryformat": 1,
    "section": 7,
